{"t":"Devovorga's Essence Mini World Change","s":"devovorga-s-essence-mini-world-change-e4adb","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Devovorga's Essence Mini World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mini World Change</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Treeling\">Haunted Treeling</a>, ..\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Achievements <a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Anmothra\">Slayer of Anmothra</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Chikhaton\">Slayer of Chikhaton</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Irahsae\">Slayer of Irahsae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Phrodomo\">Slayer of Phrodomo</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Teneshpar\">Slayer of Teneshpar</a>. Ability to kill <a href=\"#/wiki/Devovorga\">Devovorga</a>'s incarnations.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Messages\">Messages</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">In case you have some spare tentacle pieces, you can now use Devovorga's very essence to enter a boss lair!</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">Hear ye! Hear ye! Use Devovorga's Essence to fight an evil presence! Trade your every tentacle piece, to enter a boss' lair with ease!</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>When this Mini World Change is active it's possible to enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Gate\">Energy Gate</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32949,31520,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32949, 31520, 7)</a>. In there you can get the chance to fight <a href=\"#/wiki/Devovorga\">Devovorga</a>'s incarnations in exchange for <a href=\"#/wiki/Tentacle%20Piece\">Tentacle Pieces</a>. Talk to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dread%20Guardian\">Dread Guardian</a> and ask him about <b>essence</b>, then <b>yes</b>. Next, say the name of the boss you want to fight and enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Gate\">Energy Gate</a> to the south. \n</p><p>Note that unlike during the Devovorga event, only one person can enter the teleport at at time, so you can't kill the bosses with a team during this Mini World Change.\n</p><p>For those focusing on <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bosstiary</a> points, it's recommended to only kill the three weakest bosses <a href=\"#/wiki/Anmothra\">Anmothra</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Irahsae\">Irahsae</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Teneshpar\">Teneshpar</a>, which will require 75 <a href=\"#/wiki/Tentacle%20Piece\">Tentacle Pieces</a> in total. <a href=\"#/wiki/Chikhaton\">Chikhaton</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Phrodomo\">Phrodomo</a> require more pieces and are harder to kill, with a risk of wasting the tentacles depending on your level. Furthermore, they can be easily killed several times with teams when the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a> event is active.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Incarnation\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"#/wiki/Tentacle%20Piece\">Tentacle Pieces</a>\n</th>\n<th>Achievement\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Anmothra\">Anmothra</a></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Anmothra\">Slayer of Anmothra</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Irahsae\">Irahsae</a></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Irahsae\">Slayer of Irahsae</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Teneshpar\">Teneshpar</a></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Teneshpar\">Slayer of Teneshpar</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Chikhaton\">Chikhaton</a></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Chikhaton\">Slayer of Chikhaton</a></i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Phrodomo\">Phrodomo</a></td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td><i><a href=\"#/wiki/Slayer%20of%20Phrodomo\">Slayer of Phrodomo</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["rise-of-devovorga"]}